    x: 219.25006
    y: 464.6667
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Adrianne
    Text: Yes, I was the one who found the body. Beheaded is such a terrible way
      to go. At least it was an instant death and he did not suffer. Grover was a
      good man, you know the bounds of his kindness. I cannot imagine why someone
      would want to enact such violence towards him.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  ParentNodes: []
  ChildNode: {fileID: -2186291023301471932}
